{"id": "viva_genesis.composites.bioenergetic_internalization.bioenergetic_internalization", "name": "bioenergetic_internalization", "description": "A reusable bioenergetic-internalization module (Module H). An evolutionary control loop (replicator dynamics, Sojo-2014 leaky-membrane fitness) under a declining external gradient: as the geochemical pmf collapses, an efficient-pump population internalizes gradient generation and persists, while a weak-pump control collapses (the Sojo constraint). catalyst_efficiency sets the arm. Coarse-grained, deterministic reproduction (not wrapped ALife).", "parameters": {"catalyst_efficiency": {"type": "float", "default": 1.0, "description": "Active-pump (Na+/H+) efficiency (1.0 efficient; ~0.3 weak-pump control)"}, "v_start": {"type": "float", "default": 0.4, "description": "Initial external gradient (V)"}, "decline_rate": {"type": "float", "default": 0.01, "description": "External-gradient decline per step (V/s)"}, "gradient_floor": {"type": "float", "default": 0.02, "description": "Floor the external gradient decays to (V); low floor forces internalization-or-die"}}, "state": {"decline": {"_type": "process", "address": "local:EnvironmentalDeclineProcess", "config": {"v_start": 0.4, "decline_rate": 0.01, "v_floor": 0.02}, "interval": 1.0, "inputs": {}, "outputs": {"electric_potential": ["env", "electric_potential"]}, "doc": "Ramps the external geochemical gradient down over the run \u2014 the environment\nthe lineages must adapt to. Writes a linearly declining electric potential from\n``v_start`` toward ``v_floor``; the selection loop reads it and (if its pump is\nefficient enough) internalizes before the gradient collapses.", "interval_label": "1 s", "_contract": {"summary": "Linearly declining external electric potential \u2014 the environmental gradient the bioenergetic-selection loop must adapt to.", "description": "Writes electric_potential = max(v_floor, v_start - decline_rate * t), the lowering geochemical gradient that drives selection toward internalized gradient generation.", "inputs": {}, "outputs": {"electric_potential": "external geochemical gradient this tick (volt)"}, "config": {}, "math": ["electric_potential(t) = max(v_floor, v_start - decline_rate * t)"], "symbols": {"v_start": "initial external gradient (volt)", "v_floor": "floor the gradient decays toward (volt)", "decline_rate": "linear decline rate (volt/second)"}, "assumptions": ["Monotone linear decline (a controlled environmental sweep, not a scripted upgrade of the cells)."], "references": ["sojo2014bioenergetic"], "face": {"inputs": {}, "outputs": {}}, "amendments": [], "math_mathml": ["<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>&#x0002A;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>"]}, "_inputs": {}, "_outputs": {"electric_potential": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_units": "volt"}}}, "selection": {"_type": "process", "address": "local:BioenergeticSelectionProcess", "config": {}, "interval": 1.0, "inputs": {"electric_potential": ["env", "electric_potential"], "catalyst_efficiency": ["env", "catalyst_efficiency"]}, "outputs": {"lineage_fitness": ["pop", "lineage_fitness"], "free_energy_flux": ["pop", "free_energy_flux"], "internalization": ["pop", "internalization"], "mean_permeability": ["pop", "mean_permeability"], "survivors": ["pop", "survivors"], "external_power": ["pop", "external_power"], "internal_power": ["pop", "internal_power"], "maintenance_power": ["pop", "maintenance_power"], "autonomy": ["pop", "autonomy"]}, "doc": "Deterministic replicator-dynamics evolutionary control loop over membrane\nstrategies (permeability \u00d7 active-pump rate), with a Sojo-2014 leaky-membrane\nfitness. Reads the external gradient (electric potential) and catalyst\nefficiency; selects strategies \u221d free-energy flux each generation; and emits\nthe population's lineage fitness, free-energy flux, internalization fraction\nand mean permeability (overwrite sensors \u2014 the current population state).", "interval_label": "1 s", "_contract": {"summary": "Evolutionary control loop (replicator dynamics) over membrane strategies with Sojo-2014 leaky-membrane fitness: does selection internalize gradient generation as the external gradient drops?", "description": "Coarse-grained, deterministic selection model (the study's proposed primary method; not a wrapped ALife/MD engine). A grid of membrane strategies (permeability P \u00d7 active-pump rate) competes for free-energy flux = k_ext*external_pmf*P + k_int*pump*efficiency*(1-P) - c_pump*pump - c_base. Replicator dynamics select strategies proportional to flux each generation; as the external gradient is lowered the population internalizes (mass shifts to tight-membrane, high-pump strategies) only where the pump beats its cost against the lost external coupling \u2014 the Sojo leaky-membrane constraint. All outputs are overwrite sensors; the population is integrated internally.", "inputs": {"electric_potential": "external geochemical gradient available to tap (volt)", "catalyst_efficiency": "active-pump (Na+/H+) catalytic efficiency (dimensionless)"}, "outputs": {"lineage_fitness": "population mean free-energy flux (fitness) (dimensionless, normalized)", "free_energy_flux": "population mean free-energy flux (watt)", "internalization": "mean active-pump fraction of the surviving population (dimensionless, 0-1)", "mean_permeability": "population mean membrane permeability (meter/second)", "survivors": "fraction of strategy mass above the survival threshold (dimensionless)", "autonomy": "population mean of the PER-INDIVIDUAL autonomy internal / (internal + external) power (dimensionless, 0-1; Phase 6)"}, "config": {}, "math": ["flux(P,pump) = k_ext*Vext*P + k_int*pump*eff*(1-P) - c_pump*pump - c_base", "f_s(t+1) \u221d f_s(t) * max(flux_s, 0)   (replicator, + mild mutation)", "internalization = sum_s f_s * pump_s", "autonomy = sum_s f_s * internal_s / (internal_s + external_s)   (per-individual, Phase 6)"], "symbols": {"P": "membrane permeability (leakiness)", "pump": "active-pump rate", "Vext": "external electric potential / pmf", "eff": "pump catalyst efficiency"}, "assumptions": ["Coarse-grained deterministic replicator dynamics (reproducible); the proposed primary method.", "Sojo-2014 fitness: tapping the external gradient needs leak (\u221d P); internal pumping needs a tight membrane (\u221d 1-P) and pays a cost.", "Internalization is an evolutionary outcome, not a scripted upgrade."], "references": ["sojo2014bioenergetic", "lane2012origin", "lane2010chemiosmotic"], "face": {"inputs": {}, "outputs": {}}, "amendments": [], "math_mathml": ["<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#x0002A;</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#x0002A;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#x0002A;</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>&#x0002A;</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>&#x0002A;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>&#x0002A;</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></math>", "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mi>\u221d</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0002A;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>", "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&#x0002A;</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></math>", "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&#x0002A;</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&#x0002F;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>"]}, "_inputs": {"electric_potential": {"_type": "float", "_units": "volt"}, "catalyst_efficiency": {"_type": "float", "_units": "dimensionless"}}, "_outputs": {"lineage_fitness": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_units": "dimensionless"}, "free_energy_flux": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_units": "watt"}, "internalization": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_units": "dimensionless"}, "mean_permeability": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_units": "meter/second"}, "survivors": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_units": "dimensionless"}, "external_power": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_units": "watt"}, "internal_power": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_units": "watt"}, "maintenance_power": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_units": "watt"}, "autonomy": {"_type": "overwrite[float]", "_units": "dimensionless"}}}, "env": {"electric_potential": 0.4, "catalyst_efficiency": 1.0}, "pop": {"lineage_fitness": 0.0, "free_energy_flux": 0.0, "internalization": 0.0, "mean_permeability": 0.0, "survivors": 1.0, "external_power": 0.0, "internal_power": 0.0, "maintenance_power": 0.0, "autonomy": 0.0}, "emitter": {"_type": "step", "address": "local:RAMEmitter", "config": {"emit": {"internalization": "float", "survivors": "float", "lineage_fitness": "float", "free_energy_flux": "float", "mean_permeability": "float", "electric_potential": "float", "external_power": "float", "internal_power": "float", "maintenance_power": "float", "autonomy": "float", "global_time": "float"}}, "inputs": {"internalization": ["pop", "internalization"], "survivors": ["pop", "survivors"], "lineage_fitness": ["pop", "lineage_fitness"], "free_energy_flux": ["pop", "free_energy_flux"], "mean_permeability": ["pop", "mean_permeability"], "electric_potential": ["env", "electric_potential"], "external_power": ["pop", "external_power"], "internal_power": ["pop", "internal_power"], "maintenance_power": ["pop", "maintenance_power"], "autonomy": ["pop", "autonomy"], "global_time": ["global_time"]}, "doc": "Store historical states in memory.\n\n``subsample`` records only every Nth composite tick (default 1 =\nevery tick). Use this for long runs or composites with heavy\nstate (large fields, many agents) to keep RAM bounded \u2014 the\nsaved time-series still reflects the simulation's true cadence\nvia each row's ``global_time`` field.\n\n``max_len`` optionally bounds ``history`` to the most recent N\nrecorded rows (a ring buffer): once the cap is reached each new\nrecord drops the oldest. Default ``None`` = unbounded (the\nhistorical behaviour \u2014 consumers such as v2ecoli that read the\nfull ``history`` are unaffected unless they opt in). ``max_len``\ncounts *recorded* rows (i.e. post-``subsample``).", "_contract": {"summary": "type(object) -> the object's type", "description": "type(name, bases, dict, **kwds) -> a new type", "inputs": {}, "outputs": {}, "config": {}, "math": [], "symbols": {}, "assumptions": [], "references": [], "face": {"inputs": {}, "outputs": {}}, "amendments": []}, "_inputs": {"internalization": "float", "survivors": "float", "lineage_fitness": "float", "free_energy_flux": "float", "mean_permeability": "float", "electric_potential": "float", "external_power": "float", "internal_power": "float", "maintenance_power": "float", "autonomy": "float", "global_time": "float"}, "_outputs": {"results": "node"}}, "_declared_emit_paths": ["pop/internalization", "pop/survivors", "pop/lineage_fitness", "pop/free_energy_flux", "pop/mean_permeability", "pop/autonomy", "env/electric_potential", "global_time", "pop/external_power", "pop/internal_power", "pop/maintenance_power"]}, "schema": {}, "overrides": {}, "requires": {}, "tags": [], "visualizations": [{"name": "bioenergetic-internalization", "address": "local:BioenergeticInternalizationViz", "config": {"title": "Selection internalizes the gradient"}}], "analyses": [], "emitters": [{"address": "local:ParquetEmitter", "paths": ["pop/internalization", "pop/survivors", "pop/lineage_fitness", "pop/free_energy_flux", "pop/mean_permeability", "pop/autonomy", "env/electric_potential", "global_time"]}], "kind": "generator", "module": "viva_genesis.composites.bioenergetic_internalization", "default_n_steps": 40, "preferred_time": "1000 years", "svg": null, "wiring_status": "ready", "run_kind": "temporal", "notice": null}